{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29922","headline":"秋日零陵与幕下诸宾游河夜饮 · 郑史","name":"秋日零陵与幕下诸宾游河夜饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘月苹风乍畅襟，烛前江水练千寻。\n新秋宋玉能爲赋，永夕袁安好共吟。\n辇下翠蛾须强展，尊中绿蚁且徐斟。\n汀沙渐有珠凝露，缓棹兰桡任夜深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}